 stay in the order they came in</text></svg>","layers":[],"steps":[],"panels":[]},{"type":"heading","id":"buscar","number":"3.6.3","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking up without failing"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Reading a key that does not exist is a failure. When you do not know whether it is there, use "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Buscar","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":": it returns "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Algo","literalBoolean"],["(","punctuation"],["value","identifier"],[")","punctuation"]]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Nada","literalBoolean"]]},{"type":"text","text":", and you handle it with "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Segun","keywordStructured"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"program","id":"buscar","title":"Asking before reading","source":"Algoritmo Buscar\n  Definir edades Como Diccionario<Cadena, Entero> <- Diccionario();\n  edades[\"Ana\"] <- 12;\n  Segun edades.Buscar(\"Eva\") Hacer\n    Algo(edad): Escribir \"tiene \", edad;\n    Nada: Escribir \"no está\";\n  FinSegun\nFinAlgoritmo\n","lines":[[["Algoritmo","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Buscar","identifier"]],[["  "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["edades","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Diccionario","type"],["<","operator"],["Cadena","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["Entero","type"],[">","operator"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["Diccionario","type"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["edades","identifier"],["[","punctuation"],["\"Ana\"","literalString"],["]","punctuation"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["12","literalNumber"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Segun","keywordStructured"],[" "],["edades","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["Buscar","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["\"Eva\"","literalString"],[")","punctuation"],[" "],["Hacer","keywordStructured"]],[["    "],["Algo","literalBoolean"],["(","punctuation"],["edad","identifier"],[")","punctuation"],[":","punctuation"],[" "],["Escribir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["\"tiene \"","literalString"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["edad","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["    "],["Nada","literalBoolean"],[":","punctuation"],[" "],["Escribir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["\"no está\"","literalString"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["FinSegun","keywordStructured"]],[["FinAlgoritmo","keywordStructured"]]],"executed":true,"output":"no está\n","termination":"completed","diagnostics":[]},{"type":"callout","kind":"limit","collapsible":false,"blocks":[{"type":"list","ordered":false,"entries":[[{"type":"text","text":"Allowed keys: "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Entero","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Caracter","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Cadena","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Logico","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":" or an enumeration. Strings are compared character by character, without normalising."}],[{"type":"text","text":"It is a shared reference, like a vector, with the same memory limits."}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["Eliminar","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["key","identifier"],[")","punctuation"]]},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Algo","literalBoolean"],["(","punctuation"],["value","identifier"],[")","punctuation"]]},{"type":"text","text":" if it removed it or "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Nada","literalBoolean"]]},{"type":"text","text":" if it was not there; removing and inserting again places the key at the end."}]]}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"errors","collapsible":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Reading a missing key stops the program:"}]},{"type":"program","id":"ausente","title":"A key that is not there","source":"Algoritmo Ausente\n  Definir d Como Diccionario<Cadena, Entero> <- Diccionario();\n  Escribir d[\"nadie\"];\nFinAlgoritmo\n","lines":[[["Algoritmo","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Ausente","identifier"]],[["  "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["d","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Diccionario","type"],["<","operator"],["Cadena","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["Entero","type"],[">","operator"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["Diccionario","type"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Escribir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["d","identifier"],["[","punctuation"],["\"nadie\"","literalString"],["]","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["FinAlgoritmo","keywordStructured"]]],"executed":true,"output":"","termination":"failed","diagnostics":[{"code":"missingDictionaryKey","severity":"error","line":3,"column":12,"message":"The key does not exist in the dictionary"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"And not every type works as a key:"}]},{"type":"program","id":"clave-real","title":"A real key","source":"Algoritmo ClaveReal\n  Definir d Como Diccionario<Real, Entero>;\nFinAlgoritmo\n","lines":[[["Algoritmo","keywordStructured"],[" "],["ClaveReal","identifier"]],[["  "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["d","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Diccionario","type"],["<","operator"],["Real","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["Entero","type"],[">","operator"],[";","punctuation"]],[["FinAlgoritmo","keywordStructured"]]],"executed":true,"output":"","termination":"failed","diagnostics":[{"code":"invalidDictionaryKeyType","severity":"error","line":2,"column":18,"message":"The dictionary key type is not allowed"}]}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"inside","collapsible":true,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The engine keeps the entries in order in a list and maintains a separate hash index to find them quickly. When it grows or accumulates gaps from removals, it reorganises the index without changing the order of the entries. That is why the output order does not depend on the machine."}]},{"type":"intermediate","program":"buscar","lines":["module Buscar es","class \"$dictionary<string,integer>\" { \"$key\": str, \"$leaf:value\": i64 }","func suspendible @main() -> unit {","b0() mass 3:","  stmt.enter @2:3-2:67","  %0 = collection.new obj<\"$dictionary<string,integer>\"> @2:54-2:67","  stmt.exit @2:3-2:67","  stmt.enter @3:3-3:22","  %1 = const.str \"Ana\" @3:10-3:15","  %2 = const.i64 12 @3:20-3:22","  collection.store %0, %1, %2 @3:3-3:22","  stmt.exit @3:3-3:22","  stmt.enter @4:3-7:11","  %3 = const.str \"Eva\" @4:23-4:28","  %4 = collection.lookup %0, %3 @4:9-4:29","  %5 = const.i64 0","  %6 = int.cmp ge, %4, %5 @4:9-4:29","  branch %6, b1(), b2()","b1() mass 0:","  %7 = collection.load i64, %0, %4, 0 @4:9-4:29","  %8 = const.i64 0","  %9 = const.i64 1","  %10 = value.reinterpret i64, %7","  jump b3(%9, %10)","b2() mass 0:","  %11 = const.i64 0","  %12 = const.i64 0","  jump b3(%12, %11)","b3(%13: i64, %14: i64) mass 0:","  %15 = const.i64 1 @5:5-5:15","  %16 = int.cmp eq, %13, %15","  branch %16, b6(), b8()","b4() mass 0:","  stmt.exit @4:3-7:11","  return @8:1-8:13","b5() mass 0:","  decide.none @4:3-7:11","  jump b4()","b6() mass 2:","  %17 = const.i64 0","  decide.case %17 @4:3-7:11","  stmt.enter @5:5-5:15","  %18 = value.reinterpret i64, %14","  stmt.exit @5:5-5:15","  stmt.enter @5:17-5:40","  %19 = const.str \"tiene \" @5:26-5:34","  out.write %19, %18, newline @5:17-5:40","  stmt.exit @5:17-5:40","  jump b4()","b7() mass 1:","  %20 = const.i64 1","  decide.case %20 @4:3-7:11","  stmt.enter @6:11-6:29","  %21 = const.str \"no está\" @6:20-6:29","  out.write %21, newline @6:11-6:29","  stmt.exit @6:11-6:29","  jump b4()","b8() mass 0:","  %22 = const.i64 0 @6:5-6:9","  %23 = int.cmp eq, %13, %22","  branch %23, b7(), b9()","b9() mass 0:","  jump b5()","}"]}]},{"type":"summary","points":[[{"type":"text","text":"A dictionary associates keys with values."}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["d","identifier"],["[","punctuation"],["k","identifier"],["]","punctuation"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["v","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" inserts or replaces; "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["d","identifier"],["[","punctuation"],["k","identifier"],["]","punctuation"]]},{"type":"text","text":" reads and fails if the key is missing."}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["Buscar","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Algo","literalBoolean"]]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Nada","literalBoolean"]]},{"type":"text","text":" and never fails."}],[{"type":"text","text":"It keeps insertion order."}]]},{"type":"see_also","links":[{"section":"tipos.vectores","number":"3.5","title":"Vectors"},{"section":"tipos.opcional-resultado","number":"3.10","title":"Optional and Result"},{"section":"control.segun","number":"6.2","title":"Multiple selection with Switch"}]}]}
